    "title": "Perfect Golf - Satisfying Game",
    "description": "Become a real golf master in a game with true physics as you challenge your skills to earn the coveted hole-in-one! Swing your way past obstacles and more as you take your shot at getting the perfect goal. \r\n\r\nIt takes a mix of skill, luck and determination but if you keep your aim true, you too can join the winners circle! Earn special keys to unlock chests for surprise rewards!\r\n\r\nCollect fun and wacky golf balls!\r\nChallenge to get the perfect shot!\r\nMultiple levels with various obstacles!",
